{# Card action affordances. Currently just the "Search on PoE Trade" balance-scale
   icon (Todo 4 part 1); built as a `.card-actions` container so part 2
   ("Add to Theory Craft") drops a second button alongside with no rework.

   Two render forms because of where they sit:
   - tradeLink(url):   a real <a>, for the full tooltip popups (uniqueCard /
     gemCard / baseCard) which are NOT wrapped in an anchor. Works with no JS.
   - tradeButton(url): a <span data-trade-url>, for the condensed browse/list
     cards, which are themselves <a> (a nested <a> is invalid HTML and spills the
     card). public/js/trade-link.js delegates the click → window.open. #}

{# Traditional balance scales (scales of justice) — self-contained inline SVG. #}
{% macro scaleIcon() %}
<svg class="trade-scale" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
     stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
  <path d="M12 4.2v15.3"/>
  <path d="M8 19.5h8"/>
  <path d="M5 7h14"/>
  <circle cx="12" cy="4.2" r="1.05"/>
  <path d="M5 7 2.3 12M5 7 7.7 12"/>
  <path d="M2.3 12q2.7 3 5.4 0"/>
  <path d="M19 7 16.3 12M19 7 21.7 12"/>
  <path d="M16.3 12q2.7 3 5.4 0"/>
</svg>
{% endmacro %}

{% macro tradeLink(url) %}
{% if url %}
<div class="card-actions">
  <a class="trade-link" href="{{ url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"
     title="Search on PoE Trade" aria-label="Search on PoE Trade">{{ scaleIcon() }}</a>
</div>
{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}

{% macro tradeButton(url) %}
{% if url %}
<span class="card-actions card-actions--overlay">
  <span class="trade-link" role="button" tabindex="0" data-trade-url="{{ url }}"
        title="Search on PoE Trade" aria-label="Search on PoE Trade">{{ scaleIcon() }}</span>
</span>
{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}
